            "snippets": [
              "# Trump launches early blame game on markets and the economy\nMarket analysts and traders also attribute much of the recent volatility in stock prices to fear over Trump’s bitter trade war with China and concern that corporate profits have hit their high point for the current economic expansion, which is now in its 10th year and approaching the longest expansion on record. Panic over Democratic gains in Congress does not rank high on the list of worries",
